    {
      "id": "p0060-b002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "Before Undertale’s English release, Toby told me that he intended to release the game in Japanese sometime. He faced some big questions, though. How do you get a game translated and localized? And how do you ensure the final product is good if you don’t even know the language yourself?",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.289181,
          0.097143,
          0.897877,
          0.167857
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.2872843537414966,
          0.09880714285714287,
          0.904338775510204,
          0.17047857142857142
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "在 Undertale 英文版发售之前，Toby 告诉我，他打算日后推出日文版。不过，他面临着几个大问题：该怎样找人翻译并完成游戏的本地化？如果自己连那门语言都不懂，又该如何确保最终成品的质量？",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": [
          {
            "start": 2,
            "end": 11,
            "italic": true,
            "lang": "en"
          }
        ]
      },
      "layout": {
        "bbox": [
          0.29234217687074826,
          0.09571428571428571,
          0.8992809523809523,
          0.16285714285714287
        ],
        "font_size": 20,
        "line_height": 1.45,
        "background": "transparent",
        "font_weight": 450,
        "text_align": "justify"
      },
      "notes": "",
      "calibration": {
        "bbox": [
          0.29234217687074826,
          0.09571428571428571,
          0.8992809523809523,
          0.16285714285714287
        ],
        "font_size": 20,
        "leading": 29
      },
      "annotations": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p0060-b003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "In this chapter, we’ll briefly look at how game developers approach localization, who Toby hired to localize Undertale, and how Undertale’s localization process worked on the inside.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.289181,
          0.177857,
          0.897877,
          0.231429
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.2872843537414966,
          0.1797642857142857,
          0.904338775510204,
          0.2323785714285714
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "本章将简要介绍游戏开发者如何开展本地化、Toby 聘请了谁来为 Undertale 做本地化，以及这个过程在团队内部是如何运作的。",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": [
          {
            "start": 32,
            "end": 41,
            "italic": true,
            "lang": "en"
          }
        ]
