    {
      "id": "p0060-b005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "Let’s say you’re just like Toby and have finished developing your own game. It’s entirely in English, but you’d like to release it in Japan and other countries too. Where do you even start?",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.289181,
          0.28,
          0.897877,
          0.333571
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.2872843537414966,
          0.2807142857142857,
          0.904338775510204,
          0.33285714285714285
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "假设你和 Toby 一样，刚刚完成自己的游戏。游戏完全是英文的，但你也想在日本和其他国家发行。该从哪里开始呢？",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": []
      },
      "layout": {
        "bbox": [
          0.29234217687074826,
          0.2792857142857143,
          0.8992809523809523,
          0.325
        ],
        "font_size": 20,
        "line_height": 1.45,
        "background": "transparent",
        "font_weight": 450,
        "text_align": "justify"
      },
      "notes": "",
      "calibration": {
        "bbox": [
          0.29234217687074826,
          0.2792857142857143,
          0.8992809523809523,
          0.325
        ],
        "font_size": 20,
        "leading": 29
      },
      "annotations": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p0060-b006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "The answer is pretty simple: translation and localization are no different from any other professional service, like plumbing, computer repair, or accounting. If you’re a big company, chances are you already have in-house staff members – or possibly an entire department – dedicated to handling such matters. Alternatively, you might already have contracts with outside agencies who can handle everything for you.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.289181,
          0.342857,
          0.897877,
          0.450714
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.2872843537414966,
          0.34405,
          0.904338775510204,
          0.45
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "答案很简单：翻译和本地化与水管维修、电脑维修、会计等专业服务并没有什么不同。如果你是一家大公司，很可能已经有内部员工，甚至整个部门，专门处理这类事务。或者，你可能已经与外部机构签有合同，可以将相关工作全部交给他们。",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": []
      },
      "layout": {
        "bbox": [
          0.29234217687074826,
          0.3492857142857143,
          0.8992809523809523,
          0.43642857142857144
        ],
        "font_size": 20,
        "line_height": 1.45,
        "background": "transparent",
        "font_weight": 450,
        "text_align": "justify"
      },
      "notes": "",
      "calibration": {
        "bbox": [
          0.29234217687074826,
          0.3492857142857143,
          0.8992809523809523,
          0.43642857142857144
        ],
        "font_size": 20,
        "leading": 29
      },
      "annotations": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p0060-b007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "But if you’re a small company, or just a single person, you’ll need to seek outside help. In this situation, your first thought might be, “Do I personally know anyone who can do this for me?” If the answer is no, then you might ask around for recommendations instead. And if that yields no leads, then there’s usually only one choice left: find someone on the Internet.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.289181,
          0.460714,
          0.897877,
          0.550714
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.2872843537414966,
          0.46214285714285713,
          0.904338775510204,
          0.5504785714285714
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "但如果你是一家小公司，或者只有一个人，就需要寻求外部帮助。这时，你首先可能会想：“我认识的人里，有谁能帮我做这件事吗？”如果没有，就可以向周围的人打听推荐。如果仍无线索，通常就只剩下一条路：上网找人。",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": []
      },
      "layout": {
        "bbox": [
          0.29234217687074826,
          0.4607142857142857,
          0.8992809523809523,
          0.5478571428571428
        ],
        "font_size": 20,
        "line_height": 1.45,
        "background": "transparent",
        "font_weight": 450,
        "text_align": "justify"
      },
      "notes": "",
      "calibration": {
        "bbox": [
          0.29234217687074826,
          0.4607142857142857,
          0.8992809523809523,
          0.5478571428571428
        ],
        "font_size": 20,
        "leading": 29
      },
      "annotations": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p0060-b008",
      "kind": "caption",
      "source": {
        "text": "As a huge video game company, Nintendo has a dedicated department for localization",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.290192,
          0.701429,
          0.584429,
          0.729286
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.2891759795918367,
          0.7021428571428572,
          0.5854430272108844,
          0.73
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "任天堂是一家大型游戏公司，设有专门的本地化部门。",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": []
      },
      "layout": {
        "bbox": [
          0.29234217687074826,
          0.7,
          0.5836727891156462,
          0.7342857142857143
        ],
