    {
      "id": "p0060-b010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "Unfortunately, searching for “hire a translator” or “hire a localizer” online will result in an avalanche of ads, sites, and companies begging for your business. Many of these services will offer to translate business documents, medical patents, video games, underwear packaging, and everything else you can think of.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.289181,
          0.744286,
          0.897877,
          0.816429
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.2872843537414966,
          0.74595,
          0.904338775510204,
          0.8195214285714285
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "然而，在网上搜索“聘请译者”或“聘请本地化人员”，会迎来铺天盖地的广告、网站和招揽生意的公司。这些服务商中，许多都声称可以翻译商务文件、医疗专利、电子游戏、内衣包装，以及你能想到的其他各种内容。",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": []
      },
      "layout": {
        "bbox": [
          0.29234217687074826,
          0.7442857142857143,
          0.8992809523809523,
          0.8285714285714286
        ],
        "font_size": 20,
        "line_height": 1.45,
        "background": "transparent",
        "font_weight": 450,
        "text_align": "justify"
      },
      "notes": "",
      "calibration": {
        "bbox": [
          0.29234217687074826,
          0.7442857142857143,
          0.8992809523809523,
          0.8285714285714286
        ],
        "font_size": 20,
        "leading": 29
      },
      "annotations": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p0060-b011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "So, with a million different companies claiming to be experts at every type of translation and localization, how do you know who to pick? In Undertale’s case, Toby experienced it all: he asked friends, he looked around online, and he even received unsolicited offers from companies with in-house localization teams.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.289181,
          0.827143,
          0.897877,
          0.898571
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.2872843537414966,
          0.8288071428571429,
          0.904338775510204,
          0.8995214285714285
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "面对无数自称精通各种翻译和本地化业务的公司，该怎么选呢？在 Undertale 的案例中，Toby 把这些途径都试过了：向朋友打听、上网寻找，甚至还有设有内部本地化团队的公司主动找上门来。",
        "status": "draft",
